WEBVTT

01:29.580 --> 01:33.130
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.700 --> 01:36.190
[Episode 19]

01:40.920 --> 01:44.450
"On the screen, the candle's shadow
deepens as night grows old.

01:45.360 --> 01:48.160
The Silver River slants
and the morning stars grow cold."

01:48.160 --> 01:50.840
Perhaps it just depicts a scene like this.

01:53.330 --> 01:54.620
You are...

01:54.640 --> 01:55.840
Liu Yuan?

01:59.580 --> 02:00.890
Exactly.

02:01.730 --> 02:03.170
Yang, let's go.

02:06.120 --> 02:07.380
Please stay, Miss Lin.

02:07.600 --> 02:09.000
I have no ill intentions.

02:09.979 --> 02:11.410
However, after spending several days here,

02:11.410 --> 02:12.980
I've been overcome by boredom.

02:12.980 --> 02:15.060
All I want is a mere chat with someone.

02:19.430 --> 02:21.000
What beautiful scenery today.

02:21.000 --> 02:22.160
It is truly rare.

02:22.480 --> 02:23.170
Miss Lin,

02:23.240 --> 02:24.440
if you are in the mood,

02:24.460 --> 02:25.790
why not stay here with me

02:25.890 --> 02:26.800
to taste some tea

02:26.800 --> 02:27.930
and admire the moon?

02:29.370 --> 02:30.530
[Auspice from the East]

02:37.190 --> 02:38.030
Prefect Wang,

02:38.200 --> 02:41.220
what brings you to my place
in the middle of the night?

02:41.240 --> 02:42.640
I had to rush here at night

02:42.640 --> 02:43.770
for a serious matter

02:43.790 --> 02:45.050
that can't be delayed.

02:45.240 --> 02:49.040
What exactly is this highly confidential
and urgent matter?

02:49.160 --> 02:50.680
Prime Minister, do you know about

02:50.680 --> 02:51.800
Lingya Tower?

02:52.640 --> 02:53.720
What tower?

02:55.050 --> 02:56.240
Lingya Tower.

02:59.550 --> 03:01.190
Lingya Tower...

03:02.960 --> 03:04.140
What's this place for?

03:04.140 --> 03:05.370
Rumor has it that it was set up

03:05.370 --> 03:07.020
by powerful figures in secret.

03:07.020 --> 03:09.870
To have fun, they make death row inmates
fight for their lives in there.

03:09.870 --> 03:12.740
Many officials in the court
are deeply involved.

03:13.160 --> 03:14.280
In the long run,

03:14.400 --> 03:16.400
I'm afraid this will harm the state.

03:17.120 --> 03:17.920
Oh?

03:19.310 --> 03:20.550
I can't believe

03:21.040 --> 03:24.100
such acts of defiance would occur
under my governance.

03:25.579 --> 03:27.760
This is the list of related officials

03:27.780 --> 03:29.700
that I've managed to gather.

03:30.100 --> 03:32.230
It is for your review, Prime Minister.

03:41.390 --> 03:43.610
How audacious of these people!

03:44.070 --> 03:47.200
This matter involves
numerous officials at all levels,

03:47.410 --> 03:48.530
even including...

03:51.310 --> 03:52.560
Including who?

03:53.350 --> 03:55.079
You are actually a nice person.

03:55.480 --> 03:56.520
It's a real pity

03:56.880 --> 03:58.940
that my heart belongs to someone else

03:59.160 --> 04:00.620
and has no room for another man.

04:00.620 --> 04:01.680
It doesn't matter.

04:02.090 --> 04:04.670
I'm already content with
a simple chat with you

04:04.670 --> 04:06.070
like a confidant of yours

04:06.120 --> 04:06.980
under the moon.

04:09.360 --> 04:10.260
Word has it

04:10.640 --> 04:12.720
that you deliberately cut your own face

04:12.720 --> 04:14.850
to avoid being married to another man.

04:16.410 --> 04:19.140
I suppose you also find me ridiculous,
don't you?

04:20.170 --> 04:21.250
No, I really don't.

04:21.519 --> 04:23.950
Instead, I find you deeply admirable

04:24.040 --> 04:25.320
for taking that action.

04:25.320 --> 04:26.840
Prior to entering this mansion,

04:26.840 --> 04:27.840
I kept wondering

04:28.320 --> 04:30.890
what kind of woman

04:30.910 --> 04:32.640
would have the courage to do so.

04:32.640 --> 04:34.500
I'm afraid my face under this veil

04:34.520 --> 04:35.680
might frighten you.

04:36.130 --> 04:38.190
I consider it a blessing of a lifetime

04:39.520 --> 04:41.510
to see your face, Miss Lin.

04:42.320 --> 04:43.780
Why would I be frightened?

05:01.150 --> 05:02.150
What do you think?

05:03.950 --> 05:05.430
The sight of your face

05:06.160 --> 05:06.920
reminds me

05:07.400 --> 05:08.800
of a line of poetry—

05:09.080 --> 05:11.410
"Scars steel her jade-like soul of grace.

05:11.860 --> 05:14.260
Her smile outshines the spring in bloom."

05:15.080 --> 05:16.940
Nian'an spoke highly of you to me.

05:17.360 --> 05:19.840
No wonder you could pass the imperial exam
with him in the same year.

05:19.840 --> 05:21.570
You are indeed knowledgeable.

05:24.240 --> 05:26.760
Prime Minister, the new son-in-law
of your choice, Liu Yuan,

05:26.760 --> 05:27.840
is also involved.

05:28.490 --> 05:31.970
[Editor of the Imperial Academy, Liu Yuan]

05:29.400 --> 05:32.000
Liu Yuan is a frequent visitor
to Lingya Tower.

05:32.080 --> 05:35.540
He has also committed several acts
of corruption and bribery.

05:36.560 --> 05:39.720
Worrying that you might be
deceived by him,

05:39.980 --> 05:41.710
I specially came to inform you.

05:42.000 --> 05:45.440
I didn't expect Liu Yuan
to be this kind of person.

05:50.090 --> 05:51.020
Prefect Wang,

05:51.720 --> 05:53.060
you did a great job.

05:54.590 --> 05:57.860
Only with pillars of the state like you

05:58.030 --> 06:00.290
can the imperial court prosper forever.

06:00.760 --> 06:02.560
I'm honored by your high regard,
Prime Minister.

06:02.560 --> 06:05.600
I was just fulfilling my duty.

06:06.400 --> 06:08.680
This matter is too importance

06:08.700 --> 06:10.220
to be taken lightly.

06:10.980 --> 06:12.650
I wonder who else is engaged in this

06:12.650 --> 06:14.730
besides you.

06:15.850 --> 06:17.270
Rest assured, Prime Minister.

06:17.270 --> 06:19.590
I haven't told anyone else yet.

06:19.620 --> 06:20.580
I even came

06:20.600 --> 06:22.010
to your residence alone.

06:22.440 --> 06:24.500
This visit is only known to you and me.

06:26.720 --> 06:28.000
Very good.

06:28.640 --> 06:30.080
Excellent.

06:49.880 --> 06:50.940
It's getting late.

06:51.610 --> 06:52.810
I shall take my leave.

07:00.560 --> 07:01.810
My Lady.

07:01.840 --> 07:03.320
My Lady!

07:07.320 --> 07:08.200
My Lady,

07:08.220 --> 07:09.190
are you alright?

07:13.400 --> 07:15.130
I'll bring Miss Lin to her room.

07:15.160 --> 07:17.560
As for you, go get some rest.

07:26.220 --> 07:28.820
If you weren't
the Prime Minister's daughter,

07:28.940 --> 07:31.070
who would have such patience with you?

07:33.370 --> 07:34.690
After we share

07:34.950 --> 07:36.590
a bed tonight,

07:38.500 --> 07:40.860
let's see if you can still be so arrogant

07:40.909 --> 07:42.570
and self-conceited.

08:02.600 --> 08:03.600
It's you?

08:04.440 --> 08:05.770
What are you doing here?

08:09.880 --> 08:10.920
Just now, that punk

08:10.920 --> 08:12.820
slipped drugs into your tea and pastries,

08:12.820 --> 08:14.550
seeking a chance to defile you.

08:14.960 --> 08:16.760
If I hadn't caught him in the act,

08:17.220 --> 08:18.560
I'm afraid you wouldn't even

08:18.560 --> 08:20.690
know how your life was ruined tonight.

08:20.960 --> 08:22.240
What an outrage!

08:22.860 --> 08:24.610
I thought he was a decent gentleman,

08:24.610 --> 08:26.940
but he is actually an animal
in human form!

08:30.520 --> 08:31.480
Hey, hold on!

08:33.080 --> 08:33.919
I'm going to kill him.

08:33.919 --> 08:34.900
Why are you stopping me?

08:34.900 --> 08:38.289
A brutal animal like him surely deserves
to be chopped into pieces.

08:38.289 --> 08:40.020
But if you kill him now, at most,

08:40.130 --> 08:41.460
you can vent your anger.

08:42.190 --> 08:44.190
In turn, this might alert the enemy.

08:44.580 --> 08:45.680
What do you mean?

08:47.690 --> 08:50.750
Killing Liu Yuan won't
bring Shen Nian'an back to life.

08:51.360 --> 08:52.760
Only by keeping him alive

08:53.120 --> 08:55.960
will we have a chance
to find the hidden mastermind.

08:55.960 --> 08:56.620
And that...

08:57.040 --> 08:59.420
is the real beginning of your revenge.

09:00.800 --> 09:03.930
Don't you long to avenge Shen Nian'an,
your beloved man?

09:04.200 --> 09:06.000
If you want to find out the truth,

09:06.840 --> 09:07.970
then take my advice.

09:09.080 --> 09:10.680
Do you know who the killer is?

09:22.640 --> 09:23.360
Uncle,

09:23.360 --> 09:25.040
you asked me to come this late at night...

09:25.040 --> 09:25.840
Ah!

09:26.570 --> 09:28.760
Isn't that Prefect Wang?

09:37.640 --> 09:39.240
Look at what you've done!

09:39.360 --> 09:41.120
Why is your name on the list?

09:48.520 --> 09:48.960
It...

09:49.100 --> 09:49.540
It...

09:49.830 --> 09:51.690
How did he find out all about this?

09:51.740 --> 09:53.270
How did he find it out?

09:54.220 --> 09:55.820
Are you seriously asking me?

09:55.920 --> 09:57.850
Shouldn't you be asking yourself?

09:57.880 --> 09:59.880
If he hadn't come meet me first,

10:00.280 --> 10:01.400
you would be brought

10:01.400 --> 10:04.600
to the Minister
of the Court of Judicial Review tomorrow!

10:04.960 --> 10:05.520
Uncle,

10:05.640 --> 10:06.840
p-please forgive me!

10:06.840 --> 10:07.360
It...

10:07.880 --> 10:08.880
It was a momentary

10:09.000 --> 10:10.000
lapse on my part.

10:11.560 --> 10:13.930
You are so careless in your work.

10:14.080 --> 10:17.210
How can I entrust you
with important tasks in the future?

10:18.270 --> 10:20.490
You reproach is justified, Uncle.

10:20.920 --> 10:21.650
I promise...

10:21.800 --> 10:23.680
to act with great caution in the future.

10:23.680 --> 10:24.280
I promise!

10:25.680 --> 10:27.920
What happened to your head?

10:28.080 --> 10:28.680
I...

10:30.600 --> 10:31.880
N-Nothing happened.

10:32.480 --> 10:33.640
I just got hurt

10:33.640 --> 10:35.560
b-by accident.

10:40.540 --> 10:43.740
Jingjing has always had a bad temper
since she was little.

10:44.360 --> 10:45.360
Some things

10:46.480 --> 10:48.400
had better not be rushed.

10:49.720 --> 10:50.680
I understand.

10:51.460 --> 10:53.780
I will follow your instructions, Uncle.

10:55.610 --> 10:57.030
Get rid of the body.

10:59.480 --> 11:00.120
Yes.

11:00.200 --> 11:01.920
Consider it done, Uncle!

11:13.160 --> 11:13.960
Master,

11:14.480 --> 11:16.280
Prime Minister Lin killed Prefect Wang

11:16.280 --> 11:17.480
to cover for Liu Yuan.

11:17.560 --> 11:19.790
Prime Minister Lin is ruthless
and decisive.

11:19.790 --> 11:21.360
There's nothing good in him.

11:21.360 --> 11:22.890
Master, are you suggesting

11:23.230 --> 11:26.520
that Prime Minister Lin
has a lot to do with Lingya Tower?

11:26.800 --> 11:28.260
How are things on your end?

11:29.170 --> 11:31.040
I've reached a consensus
with Lin Jingjing.

11:31.040 --> 11:32.740
Let's just wait and see what happens.

11:32.740 --> 11:33.520
Good.

11:41.970 --> 11:42.770
Yang.

11:45.650 --> 11:46.450
Mr. Liu.

11:48.440 --> 11:49.680
Level with me.

11:50.480 --> 11:52.560
After I brought Miss Lin back to her room,

11:52.560 --> 11:54.240
who else saw us?

11:55.080 --> 11:56.120
No one.

11:56.160 --> 11:57.760
Last night, she came out soon

11:57.760 --> 11:59.190
after entering her room.

11:59.320 --> 12:01.120
No one went in there afterwards.

12:03.000 --> 12:04.440
No one at all?

12:06.710 --> 12:08.570
Could I have been hurt by Miss Lin?

12:10.160 --> 12:10.960
Ah...

12:14.320 --> 12:15.640
Or did you attack me?

12:15.760 --> 12:16.640
No, I didn't.

12:16.760 --> 12:18.560
I was in my room the entire night.

12:18.560 --> 12:20.290
I didn't dare to take a step out.

12:23.280 --> 12:25.400
Keep a close eye on Miss Lin.

12:25.790 --> 12:27.630
Should anything happen,

12:27.760 --> 12:29.400
let me know at once.

12:29.880 --> 12:30.680
Otherwise—

12:31.480 --> 12:32.480
you know

12:32.530 --> 12:34.090
how Shen Nian'an ended up.

12:34.550 --> 12:35.830
Yes, Mr. Liu.

12:45.480 --> 12:46.280
Yang.

12:47.700 --> 12:50.360
I can't believe you're spying on me
for Liu Yuan.

12:52.920 --> 12:54.240
No, I'm not, My Lady.

13:01.280 --> 13:03.440
I heard each and every word

13:03.440 --> 13:05.520
you and Liu Yuan said just now.

13:05.540 --> 13:07.380
No need to deny it.

13:08.480 --> 13:09.320
Who are you?

13:09.840 --> 13:11.600
I don't know what you're talking about.

13:11.600 --> 13:13.280
You agreed to spy on Miss Lin

13:13.280 --> 13:15.240
for Liu Yuan,

13:15.240 --> 13:16.940
so as not to be killed.

13:17.200 --> 13:18.600
I heard that right, didn't I?

13:18.600 --> 13:21.920
He also mentioned about
how Shen Nian'an ended up...

13:22.000 --> 13:23.800
You've worked for me for a long time.

13:23.800 --> 13:26.130
How exactly did you connect with Liu Yuan?

13:28.200 --> 13:29.200
My Lady,

13:29.400 --> 13:30.560
I don't want to die.

13:30.600 --> 13:32.160
I was coerced into Liu's evil plan!

13:32.160 --> 13:33.480
Coerced?

13:34.000 --> 13:36.000
Don't you fear that I might kill you too?

13:36.000 --> 13:36.600
Confess.

13:36.760 --> 13:38.040
What exactly does Liu Yuan have to do

13:38.040 --> 13:39.500
with the death of Nian'an?

13:40.280 --> 13:41.400
My Lady...

13:43.320 --> 13:44.960
If you tell the truth now,

13:45.080 --> 13:46.480
we'll let you live.

13:48.560 --> 13:50.520
But if you dare to lie again,

13:50.600 --> 13:52.280
I'll end your life

13:52.280 --> 13:53.480
on Miss Lin's behalf.

13:53.800 --> 13:54.560
My Lady.

13:54.560 --> 13:56.000
My Lady, I'm sorry I did wrong.

13:56.000 --> 13:57.170
As long as you spare my life,

13:57.170 --> 13:59.000
I'll tell you everything I know, My Lady.

13:59.000 --> 14:00.400
My Lady!

14:05.080 --> 14:06.880
You're so talented with your hands,
My Lady.

14:06.830 --> 14:09.120
[Wish you good health, Nian'an]

14:07.280 --> 14:09.420
But judging from the characters,
this sachet

14:09.420 --> 14:10.770
isn't for Prime Minister Lin, is it?

14:10.770 --> 14:12.230
It's not, you clever girl.

14:16.480 --> 14:18.960
Deliver this to Nian'an's residence today.

14:18.980 --> 14:19.460
Got it.

14:20.070 --> 14:20.670
Wait!

14:22.240 --> 14:23.110
I remember.

14:23.130 --> 14:24.880
I must hand it to him personally.

14:24.880 --> 14:25.640
Understood!

14:27.810 --> 14:30.490
On my way to Mr. Shen's abode that day,

14:31.320 --> 14:32.680
I happened to see him.

14:33.080 --> 14:34.800
So I wanted to greet him.

14:34.800 --> 14:35.400
Mister...

14:35.490 --> 14:39.160
But then I saw him discreetly entering
a tea house through its rear door.

14:39.160 --> 14:40.290
Shortly after that,

14:40.440 --> 14:43.000
I noticed another man
went into the tea house too.

14:43.000 --> 14:44.400
That was exactly Mr. Liu.

14:44.640 --> 14:46.520
It seemed unusual to me,

14:48.020 --> 14:50.620
so I decided to go up to Mr. Shen

14:50.720 --> 14:52.360
after they both came out.

14:52.890 --> 14:53.960
A moment later,

14:54.440 --> 14:56.400
I saw Mr. Shen being carried out.

14:57.310 --> 14:58.670
I was too terrified

14:58.690 --> 14:59.810
to make a sound.

15:00.490 --> 15:01.800
At the very end,

15:02.200 --> 15:04.670
two more people came out of the tea house.

15:04.780 --> 15:05.880
Rest assured, Prime Minister Lin.

15:05.880 --> 15:07.540
I'll be on the task right away.

15:20.880 --> 15:23.000
I-I didn't see anything.

15:23.700 --> 15:24.660
Yang.
